  "name": "Cigarro del Dragón",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>This cigar has been created to mimic the breath of a dragon.</p><hr><p><strong>Draconic Breath.</strong> With an action, you can light the cigar for 1 minute. While it is lit, you can use your bonus action to exhale the smoke, emulating the breath of a dragon. Each creature in a 30-foot cone in front of you must make a <strong>Dexterity saving throw DC 15</strong> or take <strong>3d6</strong> fire, cold, lightning, poison, or acid damage (your choice), taking half as much damage on a successful save.</p><p><strong>Smoke Drawback.</strong> When you use the breath, you need to make a <strong>Constitution saving throw DC 10</strong> or take half of the damage you dealt with the breath, as the smoke burns your lungs.</p><p><strong>Dragon's Voice.</strong> Once you use the cigar, your voice becomes extremely deep for 10 minutes, making it unrecognizable.</p><p><em>The cigar is completely consumed after 6 uses of the breath attack.</em></p>",
